# Inference Chain

This project maintains a forward-only inference ledger under `.inference-chain/`.

## Session start
If `.inference-chain/resumes/resume_latest.md` exists, read it first and continue from the **current frontier**. Do not rediscover rejected hypotheses. Respect **do-not-repeat**.

## Mid-session
On meaningful changes (or before context compaction), run `/ic-checkpoint` (or write `.inference-chain/inbox/latest-update.yml`), then ask the user to run `ic ingest … && ic evolve` (or use MCP `chain_ingest_update` + `chain_evolve`).

## Session end
Run `/ic-stop` (or write `.inference-chain/inbox/latest-brief.yml`), then `ic ingest … && ic evolve && ic resume` (or MCP `chain_ingest_brief` + `chain_evolve` + `chain_resume_brief`).
